WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.598
Sam: I see more signs. The post office has one.

2
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:21.222
Look! The supermarket has one too.

3
00:00:21.223 --> 00:00:30.616
Sam: Lucky is such a great dog!

4
00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:37.669
Why can't he go to those places? Dad:

5
