Lilly: Ah-choo!

9
00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:04.533
Dad: Other people are afraid of dogs.

10
00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:11.266
Sam: What? People are afraid of

11
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:18.135
dogs? Dad: Yes, some people just don't like

12
00:01:18.136 --> 00:01:23.242
dogs. Sam: I feel sorry for those

13
00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:48.669
people. I feel sorry for the dogs

14
00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:53.324
too! Sam: Hey! I have an

15
00:01:53.325 --> 00:02:09.972
